<Project>
  <!--
    Empty Directory.Build.props that intentionally does NOT import the
    parent (/c/work/wpf-perf/Directory.Build.props). MSBuild's auto-import
    walks up the tree looking for the closest Directory.Build.props and
    stops at the first one found — so this file shields the microbench
    project from the WPF Arcade SDK integration.

    The Arcade SDK is designed for projects building WPF from source; our
    BDN project consumes the SDK's pre-built targeting pack and swaps in
    a locally-rebuilt PresentationCore.dll at runtime, which is incompatible
    with several of Arcade's source-build assumptions (DefaultReferenceExclusion
    for WindowsBase, NuGet package routing, etc.).
  -->
</Project>
